sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Op as Operator
    participant Reg as Model registry
    participant Rt as Router
    participant Old as Version N
    participant New as Version N+1
    Op->>Reg: publish an immutable version
    Op->>Rt: send 1% to the new one
    Rt->>New: canary traffic
    Rt->>Old: everything else
    Note over Rt,Old: in-flight streams stay pinned to the version that started them
    Rt->>Rt: compare quality and latency gates
    alt gates pass
        Op->>Rt: step up, then promote
        Rt->>Old: drain — do not kill open streams
    else gates fail
        Op->>Rt: route all traffic back to version N
        Note over New: the old version is still loaded, so rollback is instant
    end
